                <h4 class="text-h5 font-medium text-black">
                  The Future of Sustainable Digital Ecosystems
                </h4>

                <img
                  src="/blogs/box-3.png"
                  alt="Sustainable Ecosystem"
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                  class="w-[52px] h-[52px] object-cover shrink-0"
                />
              </div>

              <p class="text-[#454751] text-body-m font-normal pb-10">
                Exploring how technology-driven platforms are reshaping
                sustainability, recycling, and environmentally conscious user
